			"Message": "docs(Maintain): Regenerate rustdoc with Rust nightly 1.97.0\n\nAdvance the Documentation/Rust submodule to pick up regenerated rustdoc output built against Rust nightly 1.97.0 (d3cd04068, 2026-05-16), up from 1.96.0-nightly (b41f22de2, 2026-03-08).\n\nThe 455-file delta includes:\n- All static asset hashes refreshed (rustdoc-17e0aaed.css, main-fcd733ba.js, search-fd9372ac.js, stringdex-2da4960a.js)\n- Search index entries and crates.js rebuilt against the newer toolchain\n- Source link line numbers drifted in From/Into/TryFrom/TryInto blanket impl pages\n- COPYRIGHT file fingerprint updated for the new rust version\n- Terminology shift: \"Methods\" heading renamed to \"Associated Functions\" in generated HTML\n- CloneToUninit now carries `since` and const-stability annotations\n\nThis ensures the published rustdoc for Maintain reflects the current nightly toolchain, keeping inline source references and search indices correct.",
